### Local notes

Skills define how tools work. Keep environment-specific local notes
in this section. A sysadmin needs these:

- the harness repo (`app/`, `migrations/`, `tools/`, `systemd/`,
  `install/`) — read it before changing it
- the install config (`install/*.yaml`) — what THIS install differs by
